# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in real values. Never commit .env.local.

# The site's public URL, used for SEO tags, the sitemap, and OG images.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://juliettebruner.com

# Optional — once you connect a real email provider (Resend, Postmark,
# SendGrid) to app/api/contact/route.ts, its API key goes here.
# CONTACT_EMAIL_API_KEY=

# Required for the private /admin page (see README "Adding videos
# without editing code"). Pick your own password — this IS the login.
ADMIN_PASSWORD=

# You do NOT set these by hand. Once you connect a Redis database in
# Vercel's Storage tab, Vercel automatically adds one of these pairs to
# your project for you:
#   KV_REST_API_URL / KV_REST_API_TOKEN
#   UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL / UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN
# Listed here only so you know what to expect — do not fill these in
# yourself.
